	"data": "Foveated Memory — The Same Principle Renders and Remembers\n\nConnection: intake-filtering × star-system-vision\nMode: Connection weaving\nDate: 2026-09-18\n\nThe Surface\n\nOne is about knowledge management — what enters the vault's permanent memory. The other is about XR infrastructure — a central server renders, thin clients stream. They seem unrelated.\n\nThe Connection\n\nBoth systems face the same problem: selective fidelity at a system boundary. The principle that solves it is the same in both…",
